d give to the houses", "created_at": "2021-12-26T18:28:05Z", "repo": "Housing_ABM", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8f0095b98625f0a727f54ec01b72b212819fa561", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of https://github.com/AndreaVisma/Housing_ABM", "created_at": "2021-12-26T11:43:47Z", "repo": "Housing_ABM", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "39fa3c66aaa9d4935e3386215c6e3772f6a7eeee", "message": "added wealth\n\nhouseholds now have a wealth pot. the initial wealth is randomly assigned with a different weight given to each class. Consequently, households accumulate wealth by adding a portion of what they don't spend in rent", "created_at": "2021-12-26T11:43:21Z", "repo": "Housing_ABM", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "de84be07311b1008f79a8cc053b322051c0e55b5", "message": "collected plotting functions\n\ncollected all the plotting functions in one file", "created_at": "2021-12-26T11:41:55Z", "repo": "Housing_ABM", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4db054c740915c4c91649947cc61bef3399a743d", "message": "Added conscious moving decision\n\nNow households select 5 random houses, give each of them a score and go for the best. Scores depend on affordability (if not affordable, score is zero), number of rooms and distance from the center", "created_at": "2021-12-26T11:41:29Z", "repo": "Housing_ABM", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fd3a213ff7aaf7be87f22c0bad680575f9b8d69a", "message": "changed the colour of patches", "created_at": "2021-12-26T11:40:11Z", "repo": "Housing_ABM", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a6e0c01cdad201bd6966715d268921ff98044400", "message": "Delete bla.docx", "created_at": "2021-12-11T09:42:22Z", "repo": "Housing_ABM", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha":